/*
 * snippet::piece — a run of source text as it is laid out.
 *
 * A run too long to print keeps its two ends and drops the middle, and what is
 * dropped is *recorded* rather than replaced by a marker. That is what makes a
 * column a column: `Piece::width` counts what a terminal shows without having
 * to step over an escape sequence, since there is none to step over, and the
 * caret alignment of the excerpt follows from it.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::errors::snippet::piece
 * @File: ymirc/errors/snippet/piece.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
